# M-003 — MVP Release 1

**Status:** Planned  
**Target gate:** 2026-11-08 (aggressive forecast)  
**Increment:** PI-003

## Outcome

Monad MVP Release 1 satisfies PG-001 on a clean external-style workflow and is packaged, documented, provenance-bearing, security-reviewed, and suitable for bounded public technical evaluation.

## Acceptance

- WC-0009 through WC-0012 accepted;
- `product/MVP-RELEASE-1.md` release acceptance passes;
- clean-clone installation and end-to-end tests pass;
- Monad successfully dogfoods its own repository within supported scope;
- release artifacts/checksums/provenance/SBOM are available;
- critical/high risks are resolved or explicitly accepted by authorized owner;
- Product Owner records Product Goal acceptance.

